{
  "bodyHash": "/QUHipibMYE=",
  "content": "<h6 style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://github.com/Majrusz/MinecraftCommon/blob/main/Enchantments/logo.png?raw=true\" width=\"800\" height=\"160\"> <br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 本模組為遊戲添加了全新獨特的附魔效果。<br>我們精心設計這些附魔以完美契合Minecraft風格，並確保<br>盡可能保持遊戲平衡。所有附魔的詳細說明請參閱<a href=\"https://github.com/Majrusz/MajruszsEnchantmentsMod/wiki\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wiki</a>。<br><strong><span style=\"color:#f00\">自1.0.0版本起，本模組需配合<a style=\"color:#f00\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/majrusz-library\" rel=\"nofollow\">Majrusz函式庫</a>才能運行！</span></strong><br></span> <br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://github.com/Majrusz/MinecraftCommon/blob/main/Enchantments/changes.png?raw=true\" width=\"800\" height=\"85\"> <br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> - 新增<strong>19+</strong>種附魔與<strong>5+</strong>種詛咒<br>- 所有附魔效果皆可透過設定檔高度自訂<br>- 現在可為盾牌與馬鎧附魔<br>- 兼容<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enchantment-descriptions\" rel=\"nofollow\">附魔描述</a>模組<br>- 兼容<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jei-enchantment-info\" rel=\"nofollow\">JEI附魔資訊</a>模組<br></span> <br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://github.com/Majrusz/MinecraftCommon/blob/main/Enchantments/stuff.png?raw=true\" width=\"800\" height=\"85\"> <br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong>引信截斷</strong><br></span> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 當玩家舉盾格擋時，可取消周圍的爆炸。<br></span> <img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://github.com/Majrusz/MinecraftCommon/blob/main/Enchantments/fuse_cutter.gif?raw=true\" width=\"600\" height=\"338\"> <br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong>隔空取物</strong><br></span> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 採集方塊或擊殺生物時，可直接將物品收入背包（若有空間）。<br></span> <img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://github.com/Majrusz/MinecraftCommon/blob/main/Enchantments/telekinesis.gif?raw=true\" width=\"600\" height=\"338\"> <br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong>第六感應</strong><br></span> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 感知生物腳步聲並將其高亮標記數秒。<br></span> <img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://github.com/Majrusz/MinecraftCommon/blob/main/Enchantments/sixth_sense.gif?raw=true\" width=\"600\" height=\"338\"> <br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong>霜蹄行者</strong><br></span> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 當馬匹行走於水面時會生成霜冰方塊。<br></span> <img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://github.com/Majrusz/MinecraftCommon/blob/main/Enchantments/frost_rider.gif?raw=true\" width=\"600\" height=\"338\"> <br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong>還有更多驚喜！</strong><br></span> <br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://github.com/Majrusz/MinecraftCommon/blob/main/Enchantments/languages.png?raw=true\" width=\"800\" height=\"185\"> <br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://github.com/Majrusz/MinecraftCommon/blob/main/Enchantments/thanks.png?raw=true\" width=\"800\" height=\"85\"> <br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> - 俄文翻譯：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/chechnyacool488\" rel=\"nofollow\">chechnyacool488</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/nikita28466\" rel=\"nofollow\">nikita28466</a>、<a href=\"https://github.com/lottuce-yami\" rel=\"nofollow\">lottuce-yami</a><br>- 韓文翻譯：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/kw2341\" rel=\"nofollow\">0골덕0</a><br>- 義大利文翻譯：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/giovyxz_00\" rel=\"nofollow\">giovyxz_00</a><br>- 中文翻譯：<a href=\"https://github.com/Pancakes0228\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pancakes0228</a>、<a href=\"https://github.com/Andows96\" rel=\"nofollow\">Andows96</a>、<a href=\"https://github.com/Fiocher\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fiocher</a><br>- 西班牙文翻譯：<a href=\"https://github.com/crafting-Aaron\" rel=\"nofollow\">crafting-Aaron</a>、<a href=\"https://github.com/critvanilla\" rel=\"nofollow\">critvanilla</a><br>- 法文翻譯：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/member/coliop/\" rel=\"nofollow\">Coliop</a><br>- 土耳其文翻譯：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/omerkayra01210\" rel=\"nofollow\">Kaira#8571</a><br>- 烏克蘭文翻譯：<a href=\"https://github.com/unroman\" rel=\"nofollow\">unroman</a><br></span> <br><a href=\"https://discord.gg/9UF774WcuW\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://github.com/Majrusz/MinecraftCommon/blob/main/Library/discord.png?raw=true\" width=\"800\" height=\"138\"> </a> <br><a href=\"https://github.com/Majrusz/MajruszsEnchantmentsMod/wiki\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://github.com/Majrusz/MinecraftCommon/blob/main/Library/mod_wiki.png?raw=true\" width=\"800\" height=\"138\"> </a></h6>",
